WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Two thousand years ago, Jesus' first
followers left their nets and their work

2
00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.240
to go with him.

3
00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:09.700
Today, Christians live in
countries all over the world,

4
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.230
in very different lives and places.

5
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:16.300
In some countries, being baptised
can still cost a person their family,

6
00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:18.650
their job or their freedom.

7
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.640
So what does following Jesus
look like, 2,000 years later?

8
00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:26.880
In this mission, you'll explore what
Christians say a disciple is called to do

9
00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:27.750
today.

10
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:32.550
Then you'll weigh up a bold claim about
what it takes to be a true disciple.

11
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:37.410
Your mission: find out what following
Jesus looks like 2,000 years later.
